---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About & CV | Jianguo Shu" active="cv">
<p class="section-label">About me</p><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mt-3">About & CV</h1>
<p class="text-lg leading-8 mt-7">I am a master's student interested in computer vision and embodied intelligence, particularly stereo vision, 3D reconstruction, and vision-language-action models.</p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-10">
<div class="research-card"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Research interests</h2><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-4 leading-8 text-base-content/70"><li>Stereo depth estimation</li><li>Multi-view reconstruction</li><li>Embodied AI / VLA</li><li>Reproducibility</li></ul></div>
<div class="research-card"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Technical focus</h2><ul class="list-disc list-inside mt-4 leading-8 text-base-content/70"><li>Python / PyTorch</li><li>Deep learning experimentation</li><li>3D data processing</li><li>Research engineering</li></ul></div></div>
<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-12">Curriculum vitae</h2><p class="leading-8 text-base-content/70 mt-4">A reviewed public PDF CV will be provided here after confirmation of the final version and privacy-sensitive information.</p>
<a class="btn btn-outline mt-5" href="https://github.com/shujianguosjg-dot" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View GitHub ↗</a>
</BaseLayout>